tps://atlasaircons.com/zr-72-compressor-5tr/\" }\r\n            ]\r\n        }\r\n    ]\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\r\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\r\n<p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-800 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl font-medium\"><span class=\"font-bold text-golden\">Shocking Value!</span> Get the <b>best price</b> on <b>Copeland CR72/ZR72</b> and <b>DANFOSS HLP072T4LC6</b> in <b>Vadodara</b> and <b>Gujarat</b>. <span class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">Certified Parts. 3-Month Guarantee, Ac Compressor Repair And Replacement Services.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4 pt-8\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-silver-black text-center\">Interactive 3D Compressor View (Scroll/Drag to Rotate)</h3>\r\n<div id=\"canvas-container\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/zr-72-copeland-compressor.webp\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-9016 size-large\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/zr-72-copeland-compressor-540x720.webp\" alt=\"Ac Compressor Repair And Replacement Services\" width=\"540\" height=\"720\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/zr-72-copeland-compressor-540x720.webp 540w, https://www.atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/zr-72-copeland-compressor-225x300.webp 225w, https://www.atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/zr-72-copeland-compressor-600x800.webp 600w, https://www.atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/zr-72-copeland-compressor.webp 750w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 540px) 100vw, 540px\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<section id=\"product-details\" class=\"mt-16\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-silver-black border-b-4 border-golden pb-3 mb-8\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/affordable-and-expert-ac-repair-service/\">Comprehensive Product Information &amp; <span class=\"text-golden\">Price List</span></a></h2>\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\r\n<div class=\"lg:col-span-2 bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-golden mb-4\">Detailed Price List (<b>5.5 Ton AC Compressor Price</b> &#8211; Unit Only)</h3>\r\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-gray-200\">\r\n<table class=\"min-w-full bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200 price-table\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left bg-gray-100 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-600\">Compressor Model</th>\r\n<th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left bg-gray-100 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-600\">Technology</th>\r\n<th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left bg-gray-100 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-600\">Estimated Unit Price (INR)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-100\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\"><b>DANFOSS HLP072T4LC6</b></td>\r\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Scroll</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-green-600 font-bold\">₹32,000 – ₹40,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\"><b>Copeland CR72KQE-TFD-970</b></td>\r\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Reciprocating</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-golden font-bold\">₹31,000 – ₹40,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium\"><b>Emerson ZR72KCE-TFD-522</b></td>\r\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3\">Scroll (High Efficiency)</td>\r\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-red-600 font-bold\">₹38,000 – ₹45,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-4\">Prices are for the unit only. Installation, gas, and service charges are separate. Contact us for a final quote.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border-2 border-gray-100\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-silver-black mb-4\">Technical Specifications</h3>\r\n<ul class=\"space-y-3 text-md\">\r\n \t<li class=\"border-b pb-2\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-golden\">Cooling Capacity:</span> <b>5.5 Ton (TR)</b></li>\r\n \t<li class=\"border-b pb-2\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-golden\">Phase:</span> <b>3 Phase</b> (Required)</li>\r\n \t<li class=\"border-b pb-2\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-golden\">Voltage:</span> 380-420V / 50Hz</li>\r\n \t<li class=\"border-b pb-2\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-golden\">Refrigerants:</span> R22, R407C (Check model for R410A compatibility)</li>\r\n \t<li class=\"border-b pb-2\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-golden\">Application:</span> <b>AHU</b>, <b>Ductable AC</b>, <b>Commercial Units</b></li>\r\n \t<li><span class=\"font-semibold text-golden\">Technology:</span> Reciprocating or Scroll (<b>Model dependent</b>)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"mt-12 p-8 bg-gradient-to-tr from-gray-100 to-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl\">\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\r\n<div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-green-700 mb-4 flex items-center\">✅ Essential Do&#8217;s (For Longevity)</h3>\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-md text-gray-700\">\r\n \t<li><b>DO</b> always check the oil level before starting a new or repaired unit.</li>\r\n \t<li><b>DO</b> ensure the system is properly evacuated (vacuumed) before <b>Gas Refilling</b>.</li>\r\n \t<li><b>DO</b> call <b>Atlas Aircon</b> for regular maintenance to protect your new <b>compressor</b>.</li>\r\n \t<li><b>DO</b> confirm the power supply is stable (<b>3 Phase</b>) and matches the unit&#8217;s specifications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-red-700 mb-4 flex items-center\">❌ Critical Don&#8217;ts (Avoid Costly Errors)</h3>\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-md text-gray-700\">\r\n \t<li><b>DON&#8217;T</b> run the new <b>compressor</b> without checking the correct refrigerant type (R22/R407C/R410A).</li>\r\n \t<li><b>DON&#8217;T</b> attempt DIY installation; this requires a <b>certified AC compressor technician Vadodara</b>.</li>\r\n \t<li><b>DON&#8217;T</b> ignore signs of a failing Fan Motor or dirty coils; it leads to <b>Compressor Overload/Tripping</b>.</li>\r\n \t<li><b>DON&#8217;T</b> settle for non-genuine parts when seeking a competitive <b>AC compressor price</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<section class=\"mt-16 p-8 bg-gradient-to-tl from-white to-yellow-50 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-l-4 border-silver-black\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-golden text-center mb-6\">Serving All of Gujarat: Your Local <span class=\"text-silver-black\"><b>5.5 Ton Compressor</b> Experts</span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-lg leading-relaxed text-center mb-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Looking for &#8220;<b>AC Compressor Replacement Near Me</b>&#8221; in <b>Ahmedabad</b>, <b>Surat</b>, or a <b>Gujarat GIDC</b> area? <b>Atlas Aircon</b> services all of <b>India</b> from our head office in <b>Vadodara, Sayajigunj (390005)</b>. We specialize in quick, reliable service for your commercial cooling needs across:</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-6 gap-3 text-center text-sm font-medium\"><span class=\"p-2 bg-white rounded shadow-sm text-blue-700\"><b>Vadodara</b></span>\r\n<span class=\"p-2 bg-white rounded shadow-sm text-blue-700\"><b>Ahmedabad</b></span>\r\n<span class=\"p-2 bg-white rounded shadow-sm text-blue-700\"><b>Surat</b></span>\r\n<span class=\"p-2 bg-white rounded shadow-sm text-blue-700\"><b>Ankleshwar GIDC</b></span>\r\n<span class=\"p-2 bg-white rounded shadow-sm text-blue-700\"><b>Dahej GIDC</b></span>\r\n<span class=\"p-2 bg-white rounded shadow-sm text-blue-700\"><b>Vapi</b></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"text-center mt-8\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800\">Need urgent service for a compressor fault?</p>\r\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-blue-700 font-bold text-xl hover:underline hover-bounce inline-block mt-2\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/emergency-ac-repairing/\">\r\nClick here for <b>Emergency AC Repair</b> (24/7)\r\n</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</section><section class=\"mt-16 p-8 bg-gradient-to-tr from-gray-100 to-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-t-4 border-golden\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">FAQs About <b>5.5 Ton AC Compressor Replacement</b></h2>\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-gray-200\">\r\n<h3 class=\"faq-question flex justify-between items-center text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer text-gray-800\">What is the average <b>5.5 Ton AC Compressor Price in Vadodara</b>?</h3>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer text-gray-700 mt-3 pl-4\">The unit price for a new <b>5.5 Ton 3 Phase Compressor</b> typically ranges from <b>₹18,000 to ₹38,000</b> for models like the <b>DANFOSS HLP072</b> (lower end) up to the <b>Emerson ZR72</b> (higher end), excluding installation and gas refilling costs.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-gray-200\">\r\n<h3 class=\"faq-question flex justify-between items-center text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer text-gray-800\">Is it better to choose the <b>Copeland CR72</b> (Reciprocating) or <b>ZR72</b> (Scroll)?</h3>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer text-gray-700 mt-3 pl-4\"><b>ZR72</b> (Scroll) is generally more efficient, runs quieter, and handles refrigerant issues better, making it the <b>best</b> long-term choice. <b>CR72</b> is cheaper and highly durable but less energy efficient. Your choice depends on budget and long-term energy saving goals.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-gray-200\">\r\n<h3 class=\"faq-question flex justify-between items-center text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer text-gray-800\">Do you offer installation across <b>Gujarat</b> (Vadodara, <b>Ahmedabad</b>, <b>Surat</b>, <b>GIDC</b> areas)?</h3>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer text-gray-700 mt-3 pl-4\">Yes, <b>Atlas Aircon</b> provides expert supply and <b>AC compressor replacement services</b> across all major cities and <b>GIDC</b> areas in <b>Gujarat</b>, including <b>Ankleshwar</b>, <b>Dahej</b>, <b>Vapi</b>, and <b>Nadiad</b>. Call <b>+91-9727257141</b> for a fast quote.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-gray-200\">\r\n<h3 class=\"faq-question flex justify-between items-center text-xl font-semibold cursor-pointer text-gray-800\">What are the common signs that my <b>5.5 Ton compressor</b> is failing?</h3>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer text-gray-700 mt-3 pl-4\">Common signs include the unit <b>blowing warm air</b>, the <b>compressor making a loud grinding or buzzing noise</b>, the <b>circuit breaker tripping frequently</b> when the <b>AC</b> tries to start, or the outdoor unit failing to run at all (<b>AC compressor not starting</b>).</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-12 bg-gray-50 text-center rounded-t-3xl shadow-xl mt-16\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-golden mb-4\">Ready to Get Your New Compressor?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6\">Call the <b>5.5 Ton AC Compressor Experts</b> for guaranteed installation across <b>Gujarat</b>.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center space-y-4 sm:space-y-0 sm:space-x-6\"><a class=\"btn-primary flex items-center justify-center\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\"> 📞 Call Now: <b>+91-9727257141</b> </a>\r\n<a class=\"btn-secondary flex items-center justify-center\" href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">💬 <b>WhatsApp Us</b></a></div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div id=\"popupOverlay\" class=\"popup-overlay\"></div>\r\n<a id=\"minimizeButton\" class=\"minimize-button hidden fixed bottom-8 right-8 bg-silver-black text-white p-4 rounded-full shadow-lg font-semibold hover:bg-golden hover:text-black transition 